  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_003hok_1_5_003_02:1_5_003_02:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_003hok_1_5_003_02:1_5_003_02:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_003hok_1_5_003_02:1_5_003_02:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_003hok_1_5_003_02:1_5_003_02:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8e2f6446bbfe72821431378582e9ea372d029a9f594effb287a1e10558fbe6a",
      "text": "出演高级进口车广告的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_003hok_1_5_003_02:1_5_003_02:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ea79b4312943565568cfa2d2680b1b9ea55e59a073698ea05e75d56ad2866ee",
      "text": "很有趣的广告演出构思呢。\n到底会呈现出怎样的成片，我现在就很好奇了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_003hok_1_5_003_02:1_5_003_02:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b07d66b2854995c8fb3b28831542310ab2db5bdfee8674de967c688f556a89b2",
      "text": "广告的大致内容，就是开着那辆车\n和女性约会般的情境呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_003hok_1_5_003_02:1_5_003_02:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:711437ce75834c76987cf58e1e119a9116f598c9a1589db1c1aa2d21dad0ec57",
      "text": "对。但实际上并没有女演员出镜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_003hok_1_5_003_02:1_5_003_02:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a5edddcb5079eb0b1368a560ec2a2694f09249aaa7d219908598b52a471d432",
      "text": "因为和我约会的，\n是正在看广告的公主呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_003hok_1_5_003_02:1_5_003_02:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45eed83ff4921742071364ce95f475f24b68977ab324903bde31e51801c93c07",
      "text": "这句话感觉可以直接拿来当广告台词了呢。\n仿佛已经能听到观众席传来的尖叫声了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_003hok_1_5_003_02:1_5_003_02:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f47ead614328ef783345c3e189518bfebe4c5e83d2f2b153d0cff5ec5d582d8a",
      "text": "哈哈哈，要是能那样就太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_003hok_1_5_003_02:1_5_003_02:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e95691b4a5fc28ceb041ff49cc50859621de4d1c20459cd4c3f6bca0b0ec4321",
      "text": "不过，这就变成独角戏了不是吗。\n必须做到让人感觉不出违和感才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_003hok_1_5_003_02:1_5_003_02:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b50e03f03512d802edfbefe0f5171684dbf665d880897bf0da9a041342b4e8d9",
      "text": "我不想让他们后悔选了我，\n接下来一段时间我想专心练习独角戏。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_003hok_1_5_003_02:1_5_003_02:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c0cc652d1dfba90bc5bbcaf26d9cf074480631a4f6187a58990643b1e660682",
      "text": "我很期待拍摄当天哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_003hok_1_5_003_02:1_5_003_02:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f7065178200c921487b92c53680eda944c35781307fd095116b584b71b147ff",
      "text": "呵呵，我也会让拍摄现场的工作人员目不转睛的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
